---
import '../styles/tfy.css';
---
  <div class="notice">PARTICIPANT REGISTRATIONS OPEN<br/> REVIEW REQUIREMENTS BEFORE APPLYING</div>
  <header><div class="wrap nav">
    <a class="brand" href="#home">THE <span>FIGHT</span> YARD</a>
    <button class="menu" aria-label="Open menu" onclick="document.querySelector('nav').classList.toggle('open')">MENU</button>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#events">Events</a>
      <a href="#train">Training</a>
      <a href="#participate">Participate</a>
      <a href="#membership">Membership</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      <a class="btn sm" href="#tickets">Buy Tickets</a>
    </nav>
  </div></header>
  <main>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero" id="home"><div class="wrap hero-content">
      <div class="eyebrow">Logan City, Queensland combat sport & community</div>
      <h1>ENTER THE<br>FIGHT YARD.</h1>
      <p>A place to test yourself, build confidence and belong to something bigger. Structured combat sport, real local talent, and a community that shows up. Authentically. Honestly. Together.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href="#tickets">Buy Event Tickets</a>
        <a class="btn alt" href="#participate">Register to Participate</a>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <!-- MISSION: THE YARD CODE -->
    <section class="dark" id="mission"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">The Yard Code</div>
      <h3 class="section-title">Discipline Over Ego.</h3>
      <p class="lead">We believe a person who trains with discipline, competes with courage, and stands accountable to their own actions, becomes a very dangerous person in the best possible way - dangerous to complacency and accountibility, not to people.<br /><br /> <strong>The Fight Yard Exists To Build People. Authentically. Honestly. Together.</strong></p>
      <div class="code-stack">
        <div class="code-rule">DISCIPLINE <span>OVER</span> EGO.</div>
        <div class="code-rule">ACCOUNTIBILITY <span>OVER</span> PRIDE.</div>
        <div class="code-rule">AUTHENTICITY <span>OVER</span> POPULARITY.</div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <!-- ABOUT US (standalone layout) -->
    <section id="about"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Built On Refusal.</h2>
      <p class="lead">The Fight Yard was built on a simple refusal: the idea was simply not to choosing between raw energy and real integrity. We wanted both. So we built it.</p>
      <p class="lead">TFY is a Logan-born-and-bread combat and wellbeing company with experience in boxing, creating structured environments where people can test themselves - physically, mentally and socially, without trying to be someone they're not.<br /><br /> At The Fight Yard, you can show up here as you are without judgement. Our events showcase local talent. Our training builds capability and character. Our community keeps people coming back long after the adrenaline fades.</p>
      <p class="lead">We are custodians of a culture before we are promoters of an event. Every decision passes the same filter: protect the people first, the integrity of the brand second, and pursue growth third.</p>
      <p class="lead">We're not perfect, and we don't pretend to be. We're students of this game - learning, documenting, improving, and putting what we learn into practice. If you train with us, compete with us, or stand beside us, you're part of that process.</p>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-top:36px">
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">Core Values</div><h3>Discipline</h3><p>Showing up when it's inconvenient - especially then.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">Core Values</div><h3>Courage</h3><p>Stepping in the yard knowing you'll be tested.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">Core Values</div><h3>Accountability</h3><p>Owning outcomes, not excuses.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">Core Values</div><h3>Respect</h3><p>Earned in the small moments, kept in the hard ones.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">Core Values</div><h3>Opportunity</h3><p>Real pathways for local fighters and local talent — not gatekept dreams.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="tag">TFY Standard</div><h3>How We Decide</h3><p>People first. Integrity second. Growth third.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <!-- EVENTS -->
    <section class="dark" id="events"><div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">Upcoming Events</h2>
      <p class="lead"></p>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card"><div class="tag">Featured event</div><div class="event-date" style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:900;margin:10px 0">COMING SOON</div><h3>The Fight Yard: Fight Night</h3><p> Saturday 12th December </p><a class="btn sm" href="#tickets">Get Tickets</a></article>
        <article class="card"><div class="tag">Participant callout</div><div class="event-date" style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:900;margin:10px 0">NOW OPEN</div><h3>Competitor Registrations</h3><p>Submit your participant application, for match maker assessment.</p><a class="btn sm" href="#participate">Apply Now</a></article>
        <article class="card"><div class="tag">Members first</div><div class="event-date" style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:900;margin:10px 0">EARLY ACCESS</div><h3>Corner Crew Priority</h3><p>Members get tickets before the public hears a thing.</p><a class="btn sm" href="#membership">View Memberships</a></article>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <!-- TRAINING + COMMUNITY -->
    <section id="train"><div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">Two Yards. <br />One Code.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Whether you're here to build capability or find your corner, there's a door for you.</p>
      <div class="lanes">
        <div class="lane">
          <div class="eyebrow">Capability</div>
          <h3>The Training Yard</h3>
          <p>Structured, team-led sessions built on progression - not punishment. Learn the craft, earn your stripes, test when you're ready.</p>
          <div class="session">
            <div class="when">Saturday | 2pm Avaliable Upon Request</div>
            <h4>Fundamentals | Boxing</h4>
            <p>Beginners welcome.<br /> Bring: gloves, wraps, towel, water. Ages 16+. Guardian consent required under 18.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lane">
          <div class="eyebrow">Belonging</div>
          <h3>The Community Yard</h3>
          <p>Open mats, fight nights, charity showcases, local fighter spotlights and community fundraisers. These are the nights you tell your mates about — and bring them next time.</p>
          <div class="session">
            <div class="when">Coming soon</div>
            <h4>Fight Night Showcase</h4>
            <p>Local talent on the card.<br /> Family friendly: Yes.<br /> Tickets: Will be linked once confirmed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <!-- PARTICIPATE -->
    <section class="dark" id="participate"><div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Competitors & participants</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Step into the Yard.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Registration is a process, not a paywall. Applications are reviewed before anyone steps on a card - because earning the entry is part of the entry and applying does not guarantee a match.</p>
        <div class="legal"><strong>Please Be Advised:</strong> Ensure an active email address is attached upon submission in which you will recieve by email the second part of the process. <br /><br /> <strong>Contact:</strong> Fighters@thefightyard.com.au<br /><br /> This email will contain the nessessary requirements for a successful fighter stepping into the yard and in-return ensuring the yard remains safe.</div>
      </div>
      <form class="card" id="participantForm">
        <h3>Start an application</h3>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field"><label for="name">Full Legal Name</label><input id="name" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="name">Fight Name</label><input id="name" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="email">Email Address</label><input id="email" type="email" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="phone">Mobile Number</label><input id="phone" type="tel" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="discipline">Discipline</label>
            <select id="discipline">
              <option>Choose Your Discipline</option><option>Boxing</option><option>Amatuer Boxer</option><option>Pro Boxer</option><option>Stand and Bang Fighter</option><option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field"><label for="discipline">Experience</label>
            <select id="discipline">
              <option>Choose Your Experience</option><option>Boxing</option><option>Amatuer Boxer</option><option>Pro Boxer</option><option>Stand and Bang Fighter</option><option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field full"><label for="note">Notes or questions</label><textarea id="note" placeholder="Do not submit detailed medical information through this demo form."></textarea></div>
        </div>
        <div class="checks">
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" required><span>I confirm that I have read the <a href="#legal">Participant Agreement and Risk Acknowledgement</a>.</span></label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" required><span>I agree to the collection and handling of my information under the <a href="#legal">Privacy Policy</a>.</span></label>
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox"><span>I would like to receive optional marketing emails and SMS messages. I can unsubscribe at any time.</span></label>
        </div>
        <button class="btn" type="submit">Continue to Secure Signing</button>
        <p class="success" id="success">Demo submitted. In production, redirect this user to your secure registration and e-signature system.</p>
      </form>
    </div></section>

    <!-- TICKETS -->
    <section id="tickets"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Straightforward pricing</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Get in the Yard.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Clear pricing, clear conditions, no surprises at the door. Ticket terms, refund policy and venue rules are linked at checkout - because you should know what you're buying before you buy it.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card tier">
          <div class="tag">Standard</div>
          <h3>Yard Entry | General Admission</h3>
          <p>Standard admission, subject to entry conditions and venue rules.</p>
          <p class="price">Price: TBC</p>
          <a class="btn sm" href="#">Select Ticket</a>
        </article>
        </div>
      <p class="small" style="margin-top:20px">Checkout runs through a secure ticketing provider (e.g. Humanitix, TryBooking). Card data is never processed on this page.</p>
    </div></section>

    <!-- MEMBERSHIPS -->
    <section class="dark" id="membership"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Membership</div>
      <h3 class="section-title">More Than A Membership. It's A Corner To Stand In.</h3>
      <p class="lead">Everyone who steps into the Yard has a corner. Foundations hear it first. Corner Crew get the inside track. Contenders are on the path. Legacies helped build this place.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card tier">
          <div class="tag">Foundation</div>
          <h3>Yard Member</h3>
          <p class="quote"><strong>"I was here from the start."</strong></p>
          <p>Announcements, Selected Promotions and Priority News.</p>
          <p class="price">Price: TBC</p>
          <a class="btn sm" href="#">Coming Soon</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card tier">
          <div class="flag">Most Popular</div>
          <div class="tag">Corner Crew</div>
          <h3>Yard Regular</h3>
          <p class="quote"><strong>"I belong to this."</strong></p>
          <p>Early ticket access, member pricing, member offers and the inside track before the public hears a thing.</p>
          <p class="price">Price: TBC</p>
          <a class="btn sm" href="#">Coming Soon</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card tier">
          <div class="tag">The Fight Card</div>
          <h3>Yard Contender</h3>
          <p class="quote"><strong>"I'm on the path."</strong></p>
          <p>The fighter pathway: registration support, event resources and competitor communications, subject to eligibility.</p>
          <p class="price">Price: TBC</p>
          <a class="btn sm" href="#participate">Register Interest</a>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="small" style="margin-top:20px">Cancel anytime. No lock-in contracts. We'd rather earn your next month than trap it. Comming Soon.</p>
    </div></section>
    

    <!-- FAQ + LEGAL -->
    <section class="dark" id="faq"><div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2 class="section-title">FAQ</h2>
        <p class="lead">Answers consistent with our approved policies | never improvised.</p>
        <div class="card"><h3>How do I register to participate?</h3><p>Complete the participant application, provide the required documentation and complete the secure agreement-signing process. Applications are subject to review.</p></div>
        <br>
        <div class="card"><h3>Can I get a refund?</h3><p>Refund eligibility depends on the applicable ticket, merchandise or membership terms. Link to the full Refund and Cancellation Policy here.</p></div>
        <br>
        <div class="card"><h3>What does a membership include?</h3><p>Depends on your corner: Foundations get news first, Corner Crew get early tickets and member pricing, Contenders get the fighter pathway. All tiers cancel anytime.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div id="legal">
        <h2 class="section-title">Legal Head Quarters</h2>
        <p class="lead">These links are here for you to openly access and gain an understanding of how we use data given to us through our site. We here at The Fight Yard hope to be as transparent as we can with every individual visiting or passing through our website and to ensure you are fully aware of what and how your analytics are used. If any part of any document is challengable, for that specific section we will do our part in taking responsibility and will update it accordingly, aligning it with the appropriate and legal requirements. Everything outside of that will be your responsibility to uphold, for accountibility goes both ways.</p>
        <ul class="list">
          <li><a href="#">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Terms of Use</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Membership Terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Ticketing Terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Refund & Cancellation Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Code of Conduct</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Photography & Media Policy</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer"><div class="wrap footer-grid">
    <div><strong>THE FIGHT YARD PTY LTD</strong><br>
      <span class="small"><strong>thefightyard.com.au</strong><br><br /> Logan City, Queensland, Australia</span>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="#about">About</a><a href="#legal">Privacy</a><a href="#legal">Terms</a><a href="#legal">Refunds</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      <div/>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="/">Instagram</a>
      <a href="/">Facebook</a>
      <a href="/">TikTok</a>
      <a href="/">YouTube</a>
      <a href="/">Contact</a>
    </div> 
    </div>
  </div></footer>
<script>
  document.getElementById('participantForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
    e.preventDefault(); 
    document.getElementById('success').style.display='block';
  });
</script>